{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d0fc04f6658150b21b9ceba2b2a83b7b4def5690269bb2986c907439b5d634a6", "ja": "（風花達の映画の撮影は、順調に進んでいる。この後は\nいよいよ、クライマックスの対決シーン撮影だ）", "zh": "（风花她们的电影拍得相当顺利。\n接下来终于要拍重头戏的对决场景了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "d8cd9cf2a8459367ba4ff5c13894f8d4d96376e2a6414ecbd858da89d0e16b55", "ja": "すみませーん！　砂浜とコートの調整しますので、\nいったん休憩でーす！", "zh": "不好意思──！接下来要调整沙滩跟球场，\n先进入休息时间──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5c740a00de168b210c7367a956654d09070ad8518e0fbe99939061e84a947eaf", "ja": "ふぅ……あ、{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです。あの、どうですか？", "zh": "呼……啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n那个，你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a8c19558f2382e2591b391b6754aa02cd28060ca21e1b9399f3ad3acced14161", "ja": "お疲れさま、風花！　ああ、みんな熱演だな。\nこの後のクライマックスシーンの撮影が楽しみだよ！", "zh": "风花，辛苦了！嗯，大家演得都很精彩卖力。\n真叫人期待待会拍重头戏的时候呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "031d704aca8843cb63e28cabf9954b2d621ec92c61148a87fd48592b2060110c", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます！\nそう言ってもらえると、うれしいです♪", "zh": "哇，谢谢你的称赞！\n听到你这么说真是开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b27379661c18ecc3b56eb39f23e7823b84bf5c4764bc632429a44679510f59ba", "ja": "衣装の水着は……その、\nまだちょっぴり、恥ずかしいんですけど……。", "zh": "虽然穿泳装……那个，\n感觉还是有点难为情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cc67fe496d40908f56192a8470ac30cde5813aa378273fe0a3f1e22ca0335134", "ja": "そうなのか？　風花は今までにも何度か着ているし、\n撮影中は、堂々としてるように見えたけどな。", "zh": "会吗？风花以前也有穿过几次，\n拍摄时看起来也很落落大方呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1b944201757b8d99adf0e16d6f1807d1b6a9601e68609b1ef6b13abcd7aa075a", "ja": "それは、私の演じるキングは、そういう役ですし……\nビーチバレーに関しては、たくさん練習しましたから！", "zh": "那是因为，我演的王者就是这样的角色……\n我在沙滩排球这方面可是下了不少工夫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "06109b26493df1486ea731f9f59f65da3fc8ed3dc6464908cf73cb91ae9cb2a4", "ja": "超ビーチバレー界に君臨する王者。敗北を許されない\n孤高のキング。私に務まるか、不安でしたけど……。", "zh": "君临超级沙滩排球界的王者，绝对不容许败北的\n孤高之王。虽然我有点担心自己能否胜任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2d0646668287352c2d92b51a79a38ea82a37d761a328fb325d82d79f0aaff169", "ja": "{$P$}さんから見て、堂々としてた\nってことは、役に近づけたのかもしれませんね♪", "zh": "但{$P$}先生认为我看起来落落大方，\n那应该就代表我更接近这个角色了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1010_p", "source_sha256": "42c7bd3f1d3f0f209795bcb606b088de88049c2a4d2c2d89cb6eacb211435ac2", "ja": "そうだな。悪役だし、いつもとは違う雰囲気だけど、\nこういう風花もアリなんだなって思ったよ。", "zh": "对啊，虽然这是反派角色，也跟你平时的为人不一样，\n但我觉得这样的风花也很不错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3b9c99c14f5fb9324d63cfd09a79735fa0c1836f6f5af611568e0cad643c97d9", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　でも、次のシーンの撮影は\n水着で激しいアクションをこなさなくちゃだから……。", "zh": "谢谢你！不过，下个场景要穿泳装\n拍摄许多剧烈的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b1f6eeed51ef00280a64223c7748ae5db9cfa54925afc09910df9a19b5a651a9", "ja": "海美ちゃんや恵美ちゃんたちに\n気合いで負けないように、がんばらないと！", "zh": "我可不能在气势上输给海美和惠美她们，\n得加油才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1013_p", "source_sha256": "20b0caf01e55689af87174d9cd92a39743bc540f9fab0af27e7d06a3252495cb", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\nその気持ちがあれば、きっとうまくいくはずだ！", "zh": "嗯，说得对。\n只要你有这份心，一定会顺利的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "888d05aea5a60f671606e775fdbe0a4d0fc9d63e121a226a8ed0cc9225495a6a", "ja": "はい！　この映画は、劇場の枠を超えて、たくさんの\n人に私たちを見てもらうチャンスですし……。", "zh": "是！这部电影是突破剧场的限制，\n向更多人展现我们的好机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "965c96861498f1a7b271dda4096a0f229e286282b634544ada0bfcc6f7486897", "ja": "それに、うまくいけば私の新しい一面……水着だけが\n私のお仕事じゃないってことも、伝えられるかなって！", "zh": "而且顺利的话，大家会看到我崭新的一面……\n搞不好能明白我的工作不是只有穿泳装而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1016_p", "source_sha256": "42ab5d638970ab53cef71392799f9f7749b4d6564eaf6feaab488c1b33eb06e7", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。\n仕事の幅は、間違いなく広がると思う！", "zh": "就、就是说啊……\n我觉得这一定能拓展工作的范围！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "37dd6947c8bc3c7b2cc68fa3d7491f4a2a723a8cdd6acad9889ac8fed00e5790", "ja": "そうですよね！\n私、恥ずかしがったりしないで、しっかり魅せます！", "zh": "一点也没错！\n我不能再害羞了，要好好魅惑大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "644f4097f8571decf8f639cac7367c022cd05981cd2d61f95ef3e4ac9911dc61", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ありがとうございます♪\n大勢の人に楽しんでもらえるように、がんばりますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，谢谢你♪\n我会努力让更多人享受这部电影的乐趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1019_staff", "source_sha256": "c7e3ba88c632ee1a3b18c65b25d014df45d601d12debd0ae8c0548326dda7f66", "ja": "それでは撮影再開しまーす！\nみなさん準備をお願いしますー！", "zh": "接下来要继续拍摄──！\n麻烦各位做好准备──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "365329ac03d690235fe85f710baeb5a69f19da1e411a611d94bff6340d84a1db", "ja": "あっ、撮影再開みたいですね。\n{$P$}さん、いってきます！", "zh": "啊，好像要继续拍了。\n{$P$}先生，我过去啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1021_p", "source_sha256": "52026b88a0f86b28585acb4c4c497148ce22bc860b16b312b278993881c5fc9e", "ja": "ああ、頑張れよ！", "zh": "去吧，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0074_1022_p", "source_sha256": "b13a00292826db6b90f89be593c0d471528120cb4e1a6bf263a5936496bee982", "ja": "（クライマックスシーンの風花は、本当に輝いていた。\nこれならきっと、最高の映画になるだろう！）", "zh": "（拍摄重头戏的风花真的是光彩夺人。\n我想到时候一定会拍出最棒的电影！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
